# Copied in from the repo root by the `prepack` script, so npm has a readme.
#
# npm only reads a README from the package directory it publishes, never from a
# monorepo root. `files` listed README.md and no such file existed, so
# npmjs.com/package/chat-recall rendered "ERROR: No README data found!" — a blank
# page on the install surface a CLI is found through.
#
# Generated rather than committed, so the root README stays the single source of
# truth and the two cannot drift.
README.md
